WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:03,780
One weighs four to five pounds. Two of them are enough for me to eat for several sections.

2
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:06,960
Quite a temper

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:14,080
The weather on the island will make you fall out

4
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:15,280
Get the fire out first

5
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:18,820
Can be crafted into a campfire

6
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:21,330
Physical strength increased again

7
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:24,040
There is a natural mountain spring three kilometers northwest

8
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,960
The water is of high quality and can be drank directly

9
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:27,440
residence fire meat

10
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:28,600
There is even water now

11
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,040
You'd better really rely on yourselves

12
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,600
Let's add some more wood

13
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,640
The wind is getting colder

14
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,280
Just use this little firewood to save on burning.

15
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,880
Su Che's side is the worst.

16
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:38,120
It's not on fire. It's probably trembling now.

17
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,400
It doesn't have a lighter

18
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,580
You don't have it now

19
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:44,620
What does it mean to take it?

20
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:45,980
We have to keep a spark of fire, right?

21
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:47,420
A lighter saved the lives of more than a dozen people

22
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:48,540
Make the best use of things

23
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:50,140
Taking it away alone is called selfishness

24
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,420
may be its something

25
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,540
You speak for it like this

26
00:00:52,540 --> 00:00:53,940
Why didn't you go with it just now?

27
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:54,940
The fire will go out later

28
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:57,370
You come to drill wood to make fire. Don't make any noise.

29
00:00:57,370 --> 00:00:58,410
Not enough firewood to burn one page

30
00:00:58,410 --> 00:01:08,690
Everyone pick it up

31
00:01:08,690 --> 00:01:09,770
Talk to it later

32
00:01:09,770 --> 00:01:11,090
Let me go in and lie down for a while

33
00:01:11,090 --> 00:01:12,250
I've been sleeping on the sand for the past two days

34
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:13,330
My waist is almost broken

35
00:01:13,330 --> 00:01:14,810
It can't be Su Che

36
00:01:14,810 --> 00:01:16,330
Let’s not talk about whether it can be made or not.

37
00:01:16,330 --> 00:01:17,250
This kind of thatched cottage

38
00:01:17,250 --> 00:01:19,130
It doesn't even have a lighter now

39
00:01:19,130 --> 00:01:20,290
What to live with

40
00:01:28,110 --> 00:01:29,630
Are you in the wrong place?

41
00:01:31,460 --> 00:01:34,380
This place is yours, otherwise it would be impossible for you

42
00:01:34,380 --> 00:01:37,520
You even have a lighter

43
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:39,460
How do you know I don't have a lighter?

44
00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:40,820
Because your lighter was stolen by me
